---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="What this site collects about you: as little as possible.">
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>What this site knows about you</h1>
    <p class="lede">As little as possible, and nothing it sells or shares.</p>

    <h2>No tracking</h2>
    <p>
      There are no analytics scripts, advertising tags, tracking pixels or social media widgets on
      this site. It does not set cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>Your theme choice</h2>
    <p>
      If you switch to the day theme, that choice is saved in your own browser’s local storage so
      the site remembers it. It never leaves your device. Switching back to night removes it.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on Cloudflare. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes basic request data
      (such as your IP address) to deliver pages and protect against abuse, under <a
        href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">its own privacy policy</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2>Embedded videos and music</h2>
    <p>
      Some posts include YouTube or Spotify players. They stay switched off until you click them:
      until then, the page shows a preview image served from this site and nothing is loaded from
      the provider. Once you click, the player loads from YouTube or Spotify and their privacy
      policies apply.
    </p>

    <h2>Fonts and images</h2>
    <p>All fonts and images are served from this site. No requests go to font or image CDNs.</p>

    <h2>Source code</h2>
    <p>
      The site is open source, so you can check every claim on this page against the code that
      runs it.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
